SUMMARY:2 See all OWASP NYC Chapter IAM Summit 2026 Event
DESCRIPTION:Source: OWASP NYC Meetup | Tags: application security\, compliance\, security | https://www.meetup.com/owasp-new-york-city-chapter/
LOCATION:1345 Avenue of the Americas\, 1345 Avenue of the Americas\, 3rd Floor\, New York\, NY\, US OWASP NYC Chapter Summer IAM Summit 2026 @ Ease Building July 23\, 2026 Join us for this Informative IAM Event. Use code Professional Session with OWASPVIP for our special VIP Complimentary Ticket. Please put OWASP NYC after your last name to confirm you’re a OWASP NYC Member. Everyone is welcomed. www.tinyurl.com/OWASP-NYC-IAM-Summer-Summit Use code Professional Session with OWASPVIP for our special Complimentary Ticket. Join us for the inaugural New York City edition of the Summer IAM Summit to explore the latest in security and compliance through expert-led sessions and interactive discussions. Connect with peers\, address real-world IAM challenges\, and gain practical insights to strengthen your organization's digital identity strategy.Admission offers attendees access to all interactive panels\, discussions\, IAM Happy Hour - Come network and unwind with your peers for a couple of drinks on us! @4:00 pm @Ease Building 1345 6th Avenue New York\, NY 10105 (54th /55th and Avenue of the Americas) Come join Zoe\, Carlos and Guy\, all OWASP NYC
URL:https://www.meetup.com/owasp-new-york-city-chapter/
END:VEVENT
